# Canonical host + HTTPS (best effort, Netlify settings may add an extra hop)
http://creativeai-tools.com/* https://creativeai-tools.com/:splat 301!
http://www.creativeai-tools.com/* https://creativeai-tools.com/:splat 301!
https://www.creativeai-tools.com/* https://creativeai-tools.com/:splat 301!

